# Optional.
# Local development defaults to /api/v1, which Vite proxies to localhost:3000.
# Production defaults to the Render API directly, bypassing the Vercel rewrite
# so long-running deep-analysis requests are less likely to be cut off by the
# frontend proxy layer.
#
# VITE_ORBIT_API_BASE=https://<your-render-service>.onrender.com/api/v1
